OL,3,GNEWSAVirus from Europe found at two
OL,4,ABritish dairy farms
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo dairy farms have tested positive
OL,7,Ffor an animal virus, the first such
OL,8,Fcases in Great Britain.
OL,10,FShamonda virus (SHAV) is thought to be
OL,11,Fprimarily spread by biting midges and
OL,12,Fhas been detected in cattle in
OL,13,FShropshire and Powys.
OL,15,FAccording to the World Health
OL,16,FOrganization (WHO), SHAV originated in
OL,17,FNigeria in the 1960s and was found in
OL,18,Fsouthern Germany and Switzerland in
OL,19,FJune 2026.
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
