OL,3,GNEWSAVirus from Europe found at two
OL,4,ABritish dairy farms
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Animal and Plant Health Agency said
OL,7,Fthe disease was "not a notifiable or
OL,8,Freportable disease" and it coming to
OL,9,Fthe UK "was not unexpected."
